Title: Appendix 2: Building the Stack in Silicon
Creation-Date: 2026-07-10
Last-Modified: 2026-10-04
Output-Formats: 
Tagline: The thesis translated into a program: each of the seven human layers mapped to its LLM analog, the round trip as the acceptance test for Layer 4, the two routers Layer 6 has to supply rather than one, plus the eighth question the stack leaves open, motivation, and why grounding must keep the drives honest.
